<title>USA: Telemundo seeks talks on partnerships.</title>
<headline>Telemundo seeks talks on partnerships.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telemundo Group Inc on Thursday said it was pursuing discussions with potential strategic partners with the aim of expanding its programming options and enhancing shareholder value.</p>
<p>Toward that end, Telemundo retained Lazard Freres &amp; Co LLC to assist the company in the process, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it was seeking to position itself to compete more effectively in the U.S. Spanish-language television market.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
